        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100">
          <button type="button" id="ios-ne-plus-afficher" class="text-xs text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 underline">Ne plus afficher</button>
          <span class="flex-1"></span>
          <button type="button" id="ios-ok" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-cjeao text-dark text-sm font-semibold rounded hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,255,110,0.4)] transition-all">Compris</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <!-- Dialog : opt-in notifications push -->
  <dialog id="dialog-alertes" class="rounded-2xl p-0 max-w-sm w-[90vw] backdrop:bg-black/60">
    <div class="bg-white">
      <header class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3 border-b border-gray-200">
        <h3 class="font-extrabold text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9"/></svg>
          Alertes urgentes
        </h3>
        <button type="button" id="dialog-alertes-close" aria-label="Fermer" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-900 transition-colors text-2xl leading-none">×</button>
      </header>
      <div class="p-5 space-y-4 text-sm">
        <p class="text-gray-700">Voulez-vous recevoir une notification sur votre téléphone lors d'<strong>alertes urgentes régionales</strong>&nbsp;?</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-gray-700 text-[13px] list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Avis d'inondation</li>
          <li>Fermeture de route majeure</li>
          <li>Panne d'électricité étendue</li>
          <li>Avis d'ébullition d'eau</li>
          <li>Évacuations, sinistres</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">Aucune publicité, aucun spam — uniquement des situations à connaître rapidement.</p>
        <div id="alertes-ios-help" class="hidden bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs text-amber-900">
          <strong>Sur iPhone&nbsp;:</strong> les notifications ne sont disponibles qu'après l'installation du tableau de bord sur l'écran d'accueil.
        </div>
        <div id="alertes-erreur" class="hidden bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-xs text-red-900"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100">
          <button type="button" id="alertes-plus-tard" class="text-xs text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-900 underline">Plus tard</button>
          <span class="flex-1"></span>
          <button type="button" id="alertes-activer" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-500 text-dark text-sm font-bold rounded hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(245,158,11,0.5)] transition-all">Activer</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </dialog>

  <!-- Bottom-sheet iOS : prompt d'installation proactif -->
  <div id="ios-banner" class="hidden fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 px-3 pb-3 pointer-events-none">
    <div class="pointer-events-auto max-w-md mx-auto bg-dark border border-cjeao/40 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-4 flex items-center gap-3" style="box-shadow: 0 -4px 30px rgba(0,255,110,0.15), 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">
      <div class="shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cjeao/20 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-cjeao" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm leading-tight">Recevez les alertes urgentes</p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs mt-0.5">Installez Le Carrefour sur votre iPhone (3 étapes).</p>
      </div>
      <button type="button" id="ios-banner-cta" class="shrink-0 px-3 py-1.5 bg-cjeao text-dark text-xs font-bold rounded hover:shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,255,110,0.4)] transition-all">Comment&nbsp;?</button>
      <button type="button" id="ios-banner-close" aria-label="Fermer" class="shrink-0 text-gray-500 hover:text-white text-xl leading-none px-1">×</button>
